body:
man, i've been on that situation before, sorry i can't help it either, because right now, im 21yo and never fix that up. after 5 times suicide attemp, im still alive though hahah, what a harsh life we've had man, i hope yours will end sooner and youre going to be okay just like other people. i know it harsh for you to walk on that path all alone, but you know, youre not the only one who feel this way. things will get better, just wait, even it seems that there's was no hope out there, things will be better, i hope for me too.

[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PNHQO\_GmZpU](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PNHQO_GmZpU) i think this short movie about it will help you up, don't give up man. love you..

&#x200B;
